      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You don't have to build anything back up right now; you just have to let the rubble settle. The idea of finding a new \"you\" is a massive, impossible task when you've been defined by someone else for so long. Instead of trying to build, maybe just focus on the weight itself—letting it be heavy, accepting that the silence is the only constant thing you have left.",
